version: 1.0.0
title: ⚖️ Translation Judge — Scores & Votes on Translations
description: v1.0.0 | Receives 3 candidate translations from literal, literary, and technical translators. Scores each on accuracy, fluency, and style-fit. Votes for the best one.

extensions:
